{
  "id": 8833347518663,
  "title": "Celtic Mythology Tree of Life Quilt Set With Celtic Knotwork Border",
  "handle": "celtic-mythology-tree-of-life-quilt-set-with-celtic-knotwork-border-12786aba7e-12786aba7e",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the ancient beauty and deep symbolism of the Yggdrasil with the custom Tree of Life Quilt Set from Jeminise. This beautifully designed bedding set showcases a detailed Celtic mythology theme with intricate twisted tree trunks and intertwined roots, bringing a touch of nature and fantasy into your bedroom. Made to offer the perfect balance of comfort, it provides lightweight warmth in the summer and cozy, breathable comfort during the winter, making it an ideal choice for nature lovers year-round.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features customizable options where you can personalize background details, framing colors, or add custom text such as names or special sayings.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted with a 100% soft polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for a smooth, breathable, and comfortable sleep experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor bedroom decor or outdoor activities such as family picnics, camping trips, and backyard lounging.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable fabric engineered to resist pilling, fading, and wrinkling, ensuring long-lasting vibrant colors and softness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An exceptional gift choice for men, women, moms, and dads on special occasions like Christmas, Mother's Day, Father's Day, or Valentine's Day.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Tree of Life-ds12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Farmhouse</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Tree of life, Celtic mythology</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Yggdrasil, Tree of Life</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + Pillowcases (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
